<title>USA: SBS Technologies to push forward results.</title>
<headline>SBS Technologies to push forward results.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBS Technologies, Inc said on Thursday it expected to release its third quarter earnings on April 21, after the stock market close and ahead of schedule.</p>
<p>&quot;We are anxious to report on the growth of the company and opportunities that we believe lie ahead, and have decided to accelerate our scheduled date to report the results of our company's third quarter performance,&quot; Christopher Amenson, chief executive and president, said.</p>
<p>The company also said it named Clarence Peckham president of its Logical Design Group Inc.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
